Per-app setup, dev, test and build commands are in [`architecture/`](./architecture/) (`overview.md`, and `apps/<app>/` for one app) once the `architecture` PILOT module is enabled. The commands PILOT's code checks run are `commands` in `.pilot/state.json` (`python3 .pilot/pilot.py config set commands.<key> "<command>"`); `/pilot-help` lists PILOT's own commands.
